---
const APP_URL = 'https://movipacks.vercel.app';
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-primary/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 via-dark-card to-dark-card px-6 py-16 sm:px-12 sm:py-20">

      <!-- Glow -->
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
        <div class="absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-48 w-96 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-primary/12 blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-16 right-0 h-32 w-64 rounded-full bg-primary/8 blur-2xl"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
          Deja el papel.<br />
          Empieza hoy,
          <span class="text-primary">gratis.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg text-gray-text">
          En 5 minutos tu operación está configurada y sabrás exactamente
          cuánto ganaste, quién entregó qué y cuánto te deben tus clientes.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
          <a
            href={`${APP_URL}/register`}
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary px-10 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-dark shadow-xl shadow-primary/25 transition-all hover:bg-primary-hover hover:shadow-primary/40"
          >
            Crear cuenta gratis
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2">
          {[
            'Sin tarjeta de crédito',
            '7 días de prueba gratis',
            'Cancela cuando quieras',
          ].map(signal => (
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-text">
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
              {signal}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
